{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02488",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.89,
      "end_seconds": 6.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Doctor, if you're free, we can start. I've got the numbers noted down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.42,
      "end_seconds": 12.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.81,
      "end_seconds": 26.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "I've been getting puffed climbing stairs, and I wanted to get it checked. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.77,
      "end_seconds": 33.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.4,
      "end_seconds": 38.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Okay, so I've had it for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.45,
      "end_seconds": 44.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.85,
      "end_seconds": 63.59,
      "duration_seconds": 17.74,
      "text": "It feels severe to me. It just comes and goes. I've also had a bit of a cough with exercise. With bit of a cough with exercise, I'd say mild. It comes and goes. I've also been feeling unfit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.67,
      "end_seconds": 68.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.69,
      "end_seconds": 70.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.12,
      "end_seconds": 78.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.04,
      "end_seconds": 93.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.87,
      "text": "I've had depression, yes. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. I took the morning off to come in today. I've had asthma, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.2,
      "end_seconds": 96.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.38,
      "end_seconds": 103.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I've had gout, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.88,
      "end_seconds": 108.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Sure. Alright, gout, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.8,
      "end_seconds": 123.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.28,
      "end_seconds": 130.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "Fluoxetine. I take it 20 milligrams, every morning for my mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 132.13,
      "end_seconds": 137.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.84,
      "end_seconds": 142.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.01,
      "end_seconds": 151.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. I take Seretide inhaler, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.54,
      "end_seconds": 154.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Is that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.84,
      "end_seconds": 161.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "About a year now. Allopurinol, 100 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.16,
      "end_seconds": 167.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Alright, do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.86,
      "end_seconds": 172.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.92,
      "end_seconds": 175.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.41,
      "end_seconds": 188.79,
      "duration_seconds": 12.38,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I've never touched a cigarette. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I swim twice a week. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.73,
      "end_seconds": 210.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.46,
      "end_seconds": 219.5,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "I'm allergic to wheat, I get bloating. Yes, cat fur, it gives me wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.98,
      "end_seconds": 223.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Have you had any wheeze?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.22,
      "end_seconds": 225.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Definitely no wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.36,
      "end_seconds": 231.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Have you had any chest pain, fainting or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.0,
      "end_seconds": 236.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Ah, no, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.45,
      "end_seconds": 239.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.37,
      "end_seconds": 243.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.94,
      "end_seconds": 246.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.99,
      "end_seconds": 249.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 251.45,
      "end_seconds": 263.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.9,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Respiratory rate 18, blood pressure 108 over 80. Temperature 37.0, SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 84."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.38,
      "end_seconds": 268.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.5,
      "end_seconds": 286.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Listening to the whole story, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at breathlessness from low fitness or mild asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.9,
      "end_seconds": 288.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.89,
      "end_seconds": 302.32,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's breathlessness from low fitness, and we'll know more once the a peak flow is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 303.7,
      "end_seconds": 307.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "We've already done a peak flow this morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.36,
      "end_seconds": 322.92,
      "duration_seconds": 14.56,
      "text": "Great, that's useful. Build up to thirty minutes of brisk walking five days a week. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.39,
      "end_seconds": 325.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.95,
      "end_seconds": 329.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Book a review in eight weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.49,
      "end_seconds": 331.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.94,
      "end_seconds": 336.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Right, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.16,
      "end_seconds": 340.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}